  <h3 id="listbox-button-form-variant">
    Form Variant
  </h3>
  <p>
    Apply the
    <code>listbox-button--form</code>
    modifier to create a listbox button inside a form matching other form
    controls.
  </p>
  <p>
    Additionally, to allow the component to send the value from a selected
    option in a form submission, there needs to be custom
    <code>js</code>
    to populate the
    <code>select.listbox__native</code>
    with the value upon selection. If using Skin outside of eBay UI, you
    will need to account for that independantly.
  </p>

  <p>
    NOTE: This component is a bit in transiton and will likely undergo some
    changes to integrate and simplify the variant implementation. Currently,
    <code>.listbox-button--form</code>
    is used as a bit of a patch to create the form variant of the control.
    It adds some of the styles needed to do form variant styling while other
    styles are applied separately by
    <code>.btn--form</code>
    . In the future, these styles will be consolidated into
    <code>.btn--form</code>
    and will be
    <code>.listbox-button--form</code>
    will be phased out.
  </p>

