  <h3 id="menu-button-form">
    Form-Themed Menu Button
  </h3>
  <p>
    If placing a menu-button alongside a form control (e.g. textbox), you may
    wish to apply the
    <code>btn--form</code>
    modifier, which better matches the look-and-feel of forms.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>NOTE</strong>
    : a menu-button is a good candidate for a dropdown of actions that
    make
    <em>changes</em>
    to a form, but it should
    <strong>not</strong>
    be used as a dropdown for selecting and storing form
    <em>data</em>
    . Please use
    <a href=`${urls.components}/button`>
      select
    </a>
    or
    <a href=`${urls.components}/button`>
      listbox-button
    </a>
    for that purpose instead.
  </p>

