  </highlight-code>

  <h3 id="avatar-signed-out">
    Signed-Out Avatar
  </h3>
  <p>
    The
    <code>avatar-signed-out</code>
    icon is used to a represent a user that is not signed in.
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
