  <h3>Floating Label with Disabled Textbox</h3>
  <p>
    Use the
    <code>disabled</code>
    property &amp;
    <code>floating-label__label--disabled</code>
    modifier on the input element and the label element respectively to
    disable the input.
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <span class="floating-label">
        <label
          class="floating-label__label floating-label__label--disabled"
          for="first-name-2">
          First Name
        </label>
        <span class="textbox textbox--disabled">
          <input
            class="textbox__control"
            id="first-name-2"
            type="text"
            disabled>
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <highlight-code type="html">
    <span class="floating-label">
      <label
        class="floating-label__label floating-label__label--disabled"
        for="first-name">
        First Name
      </label>
      <span class="textbox textbox--disabled">
        <input class="textbox__control" id="first-name" type="text" disabled>
      </span>
    </span>
  </highlight-code>

  <h3>Floating Label with Placeholder</h3>
  <p>
    The placeholder should only be shown when the textbox is focused and there
    is no text
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
