  </highlight-code>

  <h3>Floating Label with Invalid Textbox</h3>
  <p>
    Set the
    <code>aria-invalid</code>
    property to
    <code>true</code>
    and add
    <code>floating-label__label--invalid</code>
    to the label to semantically and visually highlight the invalid state.
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <span class="floating-label">
        <label class="floating-label__label" for="first-name-4">
          First Name
        </label>
        <span class="textbox textbox--invalid">
          <input
            class="textbox__control"
            id="first-name-4"
            type="text"
            aria-invalid="true">
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <highlight-code type="html">
    <span class="floating-label">
      <label
        class="floating-label__label floating-label__label--invalid"
        for="first-name">
        First Name
